# The Vercel project's Root Directory is neolith-rs, so deploys run from the
# repo root. Upload only the Rust app; the rest (data/, game/, db.sqlite3, ...)
# isn't needed for the web build.
/*
!/neolith-rs
neolith-rs/target
neolith-rs/dist
neolith-rs/harness
neolith-rs/.bin
neolith-rs/.vercel
neolith-rs/.env*
.DS_Store
